config BR2_PACKAGE_RGOS_ROMS
	bool "rgos-roms"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_PYTHON3
	select BR2_PACKAGE_RETROARCH
	help
	  Self-generated test ROMs for the bundled libretro cores (no
	  third-party content): each boots to a distinctive two-tone or
	  solid test screen so a screenshot proves the core, the video
	  path and audio beep (GB/NES/GBA) work. Menu entries under
	  Applications -> Game launch them through rgos-game.

	  Verified on: nestopia (NES), mGBA (GBA), snes9x (SNES),
	  Genesis-Plus-GX (MD). The gambatte (GB) ROM is generated and
	  installed but has no menu entry yet: it does not render on the
	  gambatte core (known issue, see tmp/agents/HANDOVER.md).
